OL,3,GNEWSALondon Guide Dogs training centre
OL,4,Aopens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog lovers have been invited to take a
OL,7,Flook behind the scenes at the Guide
OL,8,FDogs' training centre in east London
OL,9,Ffor the first time.
OL,11,FFrom September, the charity will open
OL,12,Fthe doors to its south east regional
OL,13,Fcentre in Woodford Green for tours of
OL,14,Fits refurbished facilities, so that
OL,15,Fvisitors can understand the training
OL,16,Fjourney of a guide dog.
OL,18,FThe centre has been running for 40
OL,19,Fyears and is home to about 75 trainee
OL,20,Fguide dogs at any given time, with the
OL,21,Fdogs at various stages of training to
OL,22,Fassist people with sight loss.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
