OL,3,GNEWSALondon Guide Dogs training centre
OL,4,Aopens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniel Stacy, mobility specialist at
OL,7,Fthe charity, said they wanted people to
OL,8,Ffeel like they could "conquer the
OL,9,Fworld" with their guide dog by their
OL,10,Fside.
